From: Zaurus OS
Subject: [PATCH] src/Makefile.am: fix cross-compile build

Two real cross-compile bugs, found and fixed by actually building this
against the project's cross toolchain (not assumed from reading source):

1. INCLUDES had "-I$(includedir)". With --prefix=/usr (required for a
   Buildroot target install), $(includedir) expands to literally
   /usr/include - the cross-compiler's own safety wrapper then refuses
   the build outright ("unsafe header/library path used in
   cross-compilation"), since that's the HOST's /usr/include, not the
   target sysroot's. All the real GTK2/glib/etc headers already come in
   correctly via $(GTK_CFLAGS) (pkg-config, properly sysroot-prefixed);
   this extra flag was never needed.

2. gqmpeg_LDADD was missing -lX11 and -lm. dock.c calls XSetWMHints
   directly and ui2_dial.c calls atan2, but neither libX11 nor libm was
   ever linked explicitly - relying on getting pulled in transitively
   through libgtk-x11-2.0, which modern binutils refuses ("DSO missing
   from command line"). Same class of fix already applied to
   libgpewidget elsewhere in this tree.

Patches Makefile.am *and* the pre-generated Makefile.in in lockstep (no
AUTORECONF - this is a real 2004 automake/libtool era build system, not
worth re-running autoreconf against just for this).

Verified by a full standalone cross-compile through to a linked ARM ELF
binary with the project's actual toolchain before writing this patch.
---
--- a/src/Makefile.am
+++ b/src/Makefile.am
@@ -4,7 +4,7 @@
 INCLUDES = -I$(srcdir) -I$(builddir)    \
 	-I$(top_srcdir) -I$(top_builddir)       \
 	-DLOCALEDIR=\""$(localedir)"\"		\
-	-I$(includedir) $(GTK_CFLAGS)
+	$(GTK_CFLAGS)
 
 module_SLIK = \
 	ui2_button.c	\
@@ -190,7 +190,7 @@
 	window.h	\
 	$(module_mpg123) $(module_xmp) $(module_ogg123) $(module_radio)
 
-gqmpeg_LDADD = $(GTK_LIBS) $(LIBPNG)
+gqmpeg_LDADD = $(GTK_LIBS) $(LIBPNG) -lX11 -lm
 
 EXTRA_DIST = \
 	$(extra_SLIK)	\
--- a/src/Makefile.in
+++ b/src/Makefile.in
@@ -151,7 +151,7 @@
 INCLUDES = -I$(srcdir) -I$(builddir)    \
 	-I$(top_srcdir) -I$(top_builddir)       \
 	-DLOCALEDIR=\""$(localedir)"\"		\
-	-I$(includedir) $(GTK_CFLAGS)
+	$(GTK_CFLAGS)
 
 
 module_SLIK = \
@@ -342,7 +342,7 @@
 	$(module_mpg123) $(module_xmp) $(module_ogg123) $(module_radio)
 
 
-gqmpeg_LDADD = $(GTK_LIBS) $(LIBPNG)
+gqmpeg_LDADD = $(GTK_LIBS) $(LIBPNG) -lX11 -lm
 
 EXTRA_DIST = \
 	$(extra_SLIK)	\
